@host = http://localhost:3000

### Login as A
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@outlook.com",
  "password": "administrator"
}

### Confirm who we are
GET {{host}}/api/me

### Summary, known range: expect 5 / 1483.577 / 0
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/summary?start=2026-09-08&end=2026-09-13

### Summary, empty range: expect 0 / null / 0
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/summary?start=2020-01-01&end=2020-01-07

### Summary, bad range: expect 400
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/summary?start=2026-09-13&end=2026-09-08

### Happy path — the verified mixed day
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/daily?start=2026-09-12&end=2026-09-12

### Wider range — expect five rows, 2026-09-09 absent
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/daily?start=2026-09-08&end=2026-09-13

### Range with no entries at all — expect 200 with []
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/daily?start=2020-01-01&end=2020-01-07

### start after end — expect 400
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/daily?start=2026-09-13&end=2026-09-08

### Range too long — expect 400
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/daily?start=2020-01-01&end=2026-09-13

### Rolls silently through the regex — expect 400
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/daily?start=2026-02-31&end=2026-02-31

### Malformed — expect 400
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/daily?start=12-09-2026&end=2026-09-13

### Missing a bound — expect 400, no server-side default
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/daily?start=2026-09-12

### Typo'd key — expect 400, not a silent strip
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/daily?start=2026-09-12&end=2026-09-12&limt=5

### Anonymous — expect 401
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout

